# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
# Gas sponsor: a Sepolia-only key that tops up each phone's gas wallet, so onboarding
# doesn't stop at "Add gas money". EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are compiled into the app and
# readable by anyone with the APK: testnet only, keep its balance small.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GAS_SPONSOR_KEY=
# Optional: a different Sepolia RPC.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SEPOLIA_RPC=https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com
